		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>quelqu&#039;un peut il m&#039;expliquer le fonctionnement de PQgetResult en mode assynchrone avec plusieurs requetes.<br />J&#039;envoie plusieurs insert en une commande avec pqsendQuery(conn, commande).<br />Après, je boucle sur PQgetResult&#160; :<br />&#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;code = PQsendQuery(conn, query.c_str());</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; while(NULL != (result_in = PQgetResult(conn))) <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; {&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;try<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;{&#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;if (PQresultStatus(result) != PGRES_COMMAND_OK) <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; throw string (&quot; problem&#160; &#160;: &quot;);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;else if(strcmp(PQcmdTuples(result),&quot;1&quot;) == 0)<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;{&#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; cout &lt;&lt; &quot;requete &quot; &lt;&lt; endl;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; }<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;}<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;catch(string const &amp;chaine0)&#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;{<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; if ( PQresultErrorField(result_in, PG_DIAG_SQLSTATE) == UNIQUE_VIOLATION ) <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; v_error_code =&#160; &quot;1000&quot;;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; else<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;v_error_code = &quot;99900&quot;;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; cerr&#160; &lt;&lt; chaine0&#160; &#160;&lt;&lt; PQresultErrorMessage (result) &lt;&lt; endl;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;}<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; PQclear(result); <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;}</p><p>Mais le problème est que si la première requete contient une erreur, il va sortir de la boucle et du coup je ne pourrai plus controler les autres requetes.</p>]]></content>
